        "Worse bending, lifting, getting up from a chair or out of a car, or staying in one position for a long time; stiff for the first movements in the morning",
        "Better for changing position, gentle walking, warmth and keeping moving through the day",
        "It often starts after a lift, a twist, or more sitting, driving or bending than usual, and sometimes with no clear trigger"
